#. type: Title #
#: docs/cognition/environment-awareness.md:1
#: docs/cognition/environment-awareness.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Environment Awareness"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/cognition/environment-awareness.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"> Habitat-process loop: collect environment + health markers → compare baseline → notify on change, stay quiet otherwise.\n"
"> Related: [Issue #44](https://github.com/freeanima-org/freeanima/issues/44) (partner-facing health warning), [`self-layer.md`](self-layer.md), [`notifications.md`](notifications.md).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/cognition/environment-awareness.md:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Two channels"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/cognition/environment-awareness.md:16
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Channel                        | Cadence                                           | Role                                                                    |\n"
"| ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **System prompt** (session)    | Snapshot at conversation init / CST 02:00 rebuild | Static **environment + health baseline** (+ 用户活跃统计)               |\n"
"| **Inbox notification** (event) | On marker change vs baseline                      | Immediate surface to **user + agent**; agent via `notification_context` |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/cognition/environment-awareness.md:18
msgid ""
"Session prompts are **not** rewritten on every change — live awareness is "
"event-level. The next day-boundary (or new session) picks up the updated "
"baseline."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/cognition/environment-awareness.md:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Loop (`builtin-env-health`)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/cognition/environment-awareness.md:22
msgid "Schedule: every 5 minutes (`*/5 * * * *`), Habitat cron, `no_agent`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/cognition/environment-awareness.md:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"collect markers (banded)\n"
"  → load baseline (Redis KV `anima:kv:env-health-baseline`, else file fallback)\n"
"  → no baseline? save & quiet (init)\n"
"  → unchanged? quiet\n"
"  → changed? notify user+agent (source_ref dedupe) → save baseline\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/cognition/environment-awareness.md:32
msgid "Implementation: `src/platform/runtime/env-health/`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/cognition/environment-awareness.md:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Storage:** baseline is **KV** (no TTL) via `connectors/redis` — Redis when configured; otherwise `~/.anima/env-health-baseline.json`. On first Redis hit after an old file exists, migrate once and delete the file. Do not confuse with **Cache** (`anima:cache:*`, TTL) used by 用户活跃统计.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/cognition/environment-awareness.md:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "v1 markers (after banding)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/cognition/environment-awareness.md:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Environment:** hostname, OS, timezone label, Habitat version, boot started_at, PostgreSQL / Redis status (`connected` | `error` | `not_configured`).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/cognition/environment-awareness.md:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Health:** RSS band (512 MiB), MCP/ACP connection counts, disk free band for `FREEANIMA_HOME` (`<1GiB` | `1-2GiB` | `2-4GiB` | `4-8GiB` | `≥8GiB` | `unknown`).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/cognition/environment-awareness.md:42
msgid ""
"Continuous metrics are banded so minor jitter does not spam notifications."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/cognition/environment-awareness.md:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "System prompt sections"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/cognition/environment-awareness.md:49
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Hook id               | Order | Content                                                                |\n"
"| --------------------- | ----- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `env-health-baseline` | 15    | Environment + health baseline                                          |\n"
"| `user-activity-stats` | 16    | **用户活跃统计** panel (CST windows; day-cached; **no** change notify) |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/cognition/environment-awareness.md:51
msgid "Registered in `register-prompt-hooks.ts`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/cognition/environment-awareness.md:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "用户活跃统计 panel"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/cognition/environment-awareness.md:55
msgid ""
"User-side dialogue density only (新开 / 更新会话、用户消息 — not agent/tool "
"traffic). CST calendar windows: 今天 / 昨天 / 前天 / 近 7·30·90 天 / 近 1 "
"年. Excludes `debug` and `cron`. Refreshes with system-prompt day boundary; "
"same CST day reuses Cache (`anima:cache:user-activity-stats`). "
"Implementation: `src/platform/runtime/user-activity-stats/`."
msgstr ""

